{
  "_comment": "Chapter 07, access reviews of privileged roles: every call the PaAccessReviews module makes, with the least-privileged Microsoft Graph permission (or Azure role) from the Learn page for that call, read on October 30, 2026. Three tasks: access-reviews-plan (reads only), access-reviews-apply (the plan's reads plus the writes, used only with -Apply) and access-reviews-evidence (reads only). Get-PaArRequiredPermission returns a task's union. Tests fail when a call is made that isn't listed here for the task.",
